license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-05"
abstract: >-
  A single-file, browser-based viewer and analyzer for X-ray diffraction
  data that treats thermal history as first-class metadata. Reads HDF5
  (NeXus / Anton Paar), Rigaku RAS, and pyFAI/ALBA formats, reconstructs
  temperature-time series from instrument logs and filenames, and provides
  pseudo-Voigt peak fitting with a persistent feature database.
keywords:
  - X-ray diffraction
  - SAXS
  - WAXS
  - crystallization kinetics
  - thermal history
  - polymorphism
